{
  "schema": "turbofit.fallback-chain/v1",
  "updated": "2026-11-03",
  "policy": [
    "Context first, then model class. Shedding context is cheaper, faster and invisible to the",
    "user than swapping models, so every level that can drop its window before a smaller model",
    "is reached does so. Reaching for a smaller model only happens when the context floor still",
    "does not fit. Yield (release residency entirely) is the last level, never the first.",
    "A level is only promoted into the default chain when it has on-box evidence. Options are",
    "listed per level but never silently substituted: an option needs the same evidence to become",
    "the default for that slot."
  ],
